// Probes of `sha256_compression`: SHA-256's compression as methods of
// `Sha256`. What the generator publishes, restated, and the methods run by
// conversion on the one-block message "abc" as far as conversion goes: the
// schedule whole and the first round. All sixty-four rounds are past the
// kernel's budget for one conversion, as they are for the span functions
// (`sha256_block_tests.hthr`). Tests, not library: nothing imports this
// module.
//
// What the `runtime` generator reads (issues/runtime-generator-imports.md).
import function_ir_lower;
import function_ir_lower_calls;
